        "name": "Paul Clarke",
        "email": "pclarke@ventanamicro.com",
        "date": "2026-04-07T15:23:09Z"
      },
      "message": "feat(zalasr): add instruction documentation and alignment checking\n\nAdd description, operation() IDL, and alignment checks for all 16\nZalasr instructions via layout files:\n\n- Load-acquire: lb.aq, lh.aq, lw.aq, ld.aq\n- Load-acquire-release: lb.aqrl, lh.aqrl, lw.aqrl, ld.aqrl\n- Store-release: sb.rl, sh.rl, sw.rl, sd.rl\n- Store-acquire-release: sb.aqrl, sh.aqrl, sw.aqrl, sd.aqrl\n\nChanges made:\n- Update lSIZE.AQRL.layout and sSIZE.AQRL.layout with parameterized\n  description and operation() blocks (replacing \"No description\n  available.\" and empty operation())\n- Each instruction now documents memory ordering semantics\n  (acquire/release) and performs explicit alignment checking\n- Extend read_memory_aligned and write_memory_aligned in globals.isa\n  with aq/rl parameters for acquire/release memory ordering\n- Update all existing callers to pass 1'b0, 1'b0 for no ordering\n- Regenerate all 16 instruction YAML files from layouts",
      "tree": {
